 he scanned in  once inside Kennedy walked down a long  Corridor Sleek metal doors lined both  sides of the hall he read the room  numbers as he passed by them  it felt like the hall went on forever  when Kennedy finally approached a door  that read Number 103 it opened  automatically  he poked his head inside there was no  one just a surgical chair in the middle  of the room two white bionic arms that  look like prosthetic human arms and  several other pieces of sleek machinery  please confirm your identity by stating  your name and displaying your ID an  automated voice said Kennedy did as he  was instructed and the door closed  behind him  thank you you may take a seat Kennedy  The Voice continued  Kennedy sat in the surgical chair a red  light on the side of the chair turned  green one of the robotic arms moved  toward him and handed him a small metal  cup containing three pills  please swallow all three tablets these  are Conscious Sedation tablets they will  help you relax and block any pain during  the procedure  Kennedy took the cup and the robotic arm  retrieved a small bottle of water and  handed it to him please confirm once you  have taken the tablets  Kennedy swallowed them I have taken the  tablets Kennedy said the chair reclined  and raised up slightly  a minute passed and nothing happened  then Kennedy began to feel a soothing  surge of bliss swell up from his chest  and washed over his body the world  outside of him dissolved away along with  the sense of self  everything felt good  he felt an intimation of Hope for what  could be  he softly smiled and his eyes rolled  back  please keep your head straight and stay  as still as possible the voice said a  helmet-like half dome-shaped device  moved on to Kennedy's head it began  scanning his brain while simultaneously  drilling a small hole into his skull  once a small dime-sized hole had been  drilled the machine discarded the piece  of his skull and began implanting  hundreds of tiny threads each with  hundreds of independent electrode arrays  connecting hundreds of thousands of  electrodes to neurons throughout  Kennedy's brain it then implanted the  learner BMI device into the hole which  was connected to all the threads on the  other side finally it coated over and  sealed the device in with a skid like  super glue  please remain in your seat until further  instructions it should take around 30  minutes for the sedation tablets to wear  off  Kennedy felt a slight pain in his head  but it was mild and offset by his  growing excitement and anticipation  after 30 minutes passed the chair  returned to its upright position  congratulations you are now fully  integrated you can activate your BMI by  holding down the button on the top of  your device for three seconds before  exiting please be sure to take your  learn a BMI 6s package with you which  contains your instruction manual and  wireless charging port please note that  you must be within 20 feet of your port  to ensure reliable charging speed If you  experience any issues or complications  please visit learn a support for  additional assistance  a brief silence filled the room  thank you and have a wonderful day  Kennedy got up grabbed the small  circular box on a stand over by the door  and then left back down the hallway  he arrived back at his apartment once  inside he sat on his couch paused for a  moment and then held down the button on  top of his head  a heads-up display screen appeared in  front of him but it wasn't in front of  him  it was inside his head  [Music]  thank you so much for watching if you  would like to hear the rest of the story  The Complete audiobook is available now  you can find the link to it in the  description below once you purchase it  you will be able to download the  audiobook file directly which you can  listen to on any device anywhere even  while offline  I've been wanting to create a collection  of mid-length audiobooks for a while now  and if this one is well received it will  be the first of more to come so I would  love to hear what you think  through this medium I can explore darker  and more complex themes use language and  cover topics potentially inappropriate  for YouTube and develop longer more  fleshed out ideas all without any  limitations or restrictions concerns  about algorithms or constraints  associated with video or book format the  audiobook is one hour long and costs  only 3.99 and as a special thank you  anyone who downloads it in the first 48  hours will also receive a free ebook  file of my debut book notes from the end  of everything  as always regardless of whether you get  the audiobook thank you so much for your  continued support in any and all the  ways you do all regular content will  continue as usual and remain completely  free my goal is to continue to  thoughtfully build and expand the  content offering under the pursuit of  Wonder umbrella into all sorts of  mediums and your support and purchases  directly contribute to this growth  toward continuously bigger and more  ambitious projects in the future so  again thank you
 

